---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import HeroText from '~/components/widgets/HeroText.astro';

const metadata = { 
  title: 'Terms of Service | Hanei JP',
  description: 'Detailed legal framework and service agreement for Hanei JP projects.'
};
---
<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <HeroText title="Terms of Service" subtitle="Version 2.0 | Last Updated: April 2026" />
  
  <section class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 mx-auto lg:py-20 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
      
      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Introduction & Acceptance</h2>
      <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the services provided by Hanei JP ("The Studio," "we," "us"). By purchasing any service package, completing an onboarding form, or using our digital assets, you ("The Client," "you") agree to be legally bound by these Terms.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Detailed Description of Services</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP specializes in the rapid deployment of digital infrastructure. Our core services include 1-Page Business Websites, automated Review Engines, English Language Hubs (Hanare), and full-scale website developments or refreshes.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Financial Terms & The CapEx Model</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP operates on a Capital Expenditure (CapEx) model. Our goal is to provide lifetime digital assets with one-time investments. Work will not commence until payment is verified via Stripe or PayPal. Because we allocate developer time and secure server resources immediately upon order, all payments are non-refundable once the onboarding process has begun.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Technical Deployment & Zero-Access Security</h2>
      <p>Security is a core Hanei Standard. We operate a "Zero-Access" model. We will never ask for your login credentials for domain registrars, email accounts, or hosting panels. To launch your site, you are responsible for updating a specific website address record in your domain settings. Hanei JP provides full assistance for this process.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Delivery Guarantees & Client Assets</h2>
      <p>While we promise industry-leading speeds (24-72 hours), these timelines are contingent upon Client cooperation. The 1-business-day delivery promise only applies if all requested text, photos, and brand assets are received by 12:00 PM JST. The Client is responsible for the legality of all provided media.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">6. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
      <p>You retain ownership of your trademarks, logos, and original text content. Hanei JP retains all rights to the underlying software logic, server configurations, and proprietary code used to serve the digital assets. Upon final delivery, we grant you a perpetual, non-transferable license to use the resulting digital asset.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">7. Limitation of Liability & Force Majeure</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by Japanese law, Hanei JP shall not be liable for any indirect damages or loss of profits. We are not liable for outages caused by third-party platforms like Google, Instagram, or Stripe. Timelines may be suspended during events beyond our control (Force Majeure).</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">8. Warranty & Support</h2>
      <p>Every package includes 60 days of priority technical support covering bug fixes. Minor content updates are provided under our lifetime white-glove support policy. We do not guarantee specific search rankings or financial outcomes.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">9. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>This agreement is governed by the laws of Japan. Any legal action shall be brought exclusively in the courts of the jurisdiction where Hanei JP maintains its primary operations.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-center">
      <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Questions regarding our terms?</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-black text-2xl underline decoration-2 underline-offset-8 transition-colors">Please contact us!</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
